      ],
      "comment": "With <span lang=\"la\">sibi</span>, knowing something in oneself, for good or ill (Lewis &amp; Short); by itself, guilty: <span lang=\"la\">animus cōnscius</span>, a guilty conscience (Plaut. <em>Most.</em> 544)."
    },
    {
      "latin": "cōnscientia, cōnscientiae f.",
